lass=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809550/extras/3ed0626653a21a02fe43dd4830e7b401.webp?t=1785012025\" width=480 height=32 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809550/extras/43561beb67c4829fd566b917ee4e2b35.poster.avif?t=1785012025\" width=608 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809550/extras/43561beb67c4829fd566b917ee4e2b35.webm?t=1785012025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809550/extras/43561beb67c4829fd566b917ee4e2b35.mp4?t=1785012025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speak with unique characters, learn their histories, take on quests, and uncover the struggles that define their lives. Your journey will bring you into contact with scholars, rulers, wanderers, and those who have embraced the world's strange transformations.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809550/extras/18e9db508dafc79c2aa3809bb2714f7f.webp?t=1785012025\" width=480 height=32 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809550/extras/aeef1cd78889a3e424c525897785ad32.poster.avif?t=1785012025\" width=608 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809550/extras/aeef1cd7888